        <mxCell id="pkg" value="Packaging + sharing" style="swimlane;rounded=1;html=1;startSize=28;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#b0e3e6;strokeColor=#0e8088;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="814" width="1579" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pkg_b" value="• pyproject.toml — src layout; optional extras:  numbering (anarcii) · reduce (deeptime) · embed (torch) · dev · all&#10;• environment.yml (conda: MD stack + bioconda ANARCI + PyMOL)   ·   setup.sh (one-command bootstrap)   ·   Makefile&#10;• CI: .github/workflows/ci.yml — clean pip install + smoke tests (py3.10 / 3.11)   ·   GitHub Pages: pages.yml → liliandenzler.github.io/kinapse&#10;• tests/ (dependency-light smoke)   ·   docs/ (architecture · quickstart · pipelines · migration)   ·   README   ·   LICENSE (MIT)" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="pkg">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="28" width="1579" height="102" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Notes -->
        <mxCell id="notes" value="Notes / key facts" style="swimlane;rounded=1;html=1;startSize=28;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#f0f4f8;strokeColor=#9aa4b2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="960" width="1579" height="112" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes_b" value="• Lazy imports: optional heavy deps (torch, PyMOL, MODELLER, deeptime) load only when used — so 'import kinapse' never fails on a minimal install.&#10;• Data flow:  ground-truth PDB + MD .xtc  and  model PDBs  →  structures (prep)  →  analysis (align → featurize → reduce to 2-D → PMF → Jensen–Shannon divergence)  →  pipelines (JSD tables + figures).&#10;• pMHC is scaffolded (API-ready; current science is TCR-variable-domain only).   ·   Migrated byte-for-byte from the former TCR_Metrics — only import wiring changed." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="notes">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="28" width="1579" height="84" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

